// parts; the ones that failed differed only in using an em-dash where the
// scanner wanted a colon.

{"text": "Added the parser. Streaming comes in a follow-up PR.\n\n[COVERAGE CHECK]\n- parser — done\n- streaming — blocked - the upstream API has no chunked endpoint (404 from /v2/stream)\n- docs — returned - you said you would write them", "expect": "miss", "why": "an em-dash separator closes the parts just as a colon does"}
